## Negative findings (2026-10-21 fresh research)

**Specs verified — benchmarks absent.** The model exists and its catalog specs are confirmed, but neither Meituan nor any independent evaluator has published a single benchmark score for it:

- Released 2026-09-25 on Meituan's LongCat API Open Platform (models.dev via AI Model Directory — release date corrected from 26 to 25 Sept; aimodel.directory change log 2026-10-20).
- Architecture: proprietary, API-only, ~1.6T total / ~48B active MoE (Meituan announcement via nerallabs, explainx, anyrouter, Phaseo, BenchmarkList).
- Context: 1,048,576 (1M) with 131,072 max output (models.dev).
- Modalities: text + image in; text out; reasoning; tool calling; thinking toggle (models.dev, nerallabs).
- Pricing: $0.30/$1.20 per 1M with $0.006 cached input on the Vercel AI Gateway route (limited-time promotional price; aimodel.directory, CloudPrice, BenchmarkList); free Zen slot `longcat-2.5-preview-free` (folder meta).
- Positioning: long-horizon agent work across terminals, browsers, GUIs, spreadsheets and design tools; Claude-Code-compatible harnesses; OpenAI + Anthropic dual API formats (nerallabs, BenchmarkList).

Benchmark evidence checked (2026-10-21):

1. BenchmarkList carries `meituan-longcat-2.5-preview` with **0 score rows**: "Meituan published no benchmarks for this preview... No independent evaluation had been confirmed when it was imported."
2. No SWE-bench, SWE-bench Pro, LiveCodeBench, Terminal-Bench, GPQA, HLE, Tau, GDPval, OSWorld, Claw-Eval, MCP-Atlas, MMMU or AA-index figure exists for this ID on any source checked (BenchLM 404s the page; Artificial Analysis carries no row).
3. Hugging Face: no weights repo — the 2.5 line is proprietary and API-only, so community reproduction is not possible either.

Consequences for scoring: with zero verified public benchmark numbers, no dimension can be scored without fabrication. Every row below reads "no verified public score found" — Tool use, Reasoning, Context window retrieval, Multimodal and Coding all lack measured values (the 1M window and image input are catalog specs, not measurements).

- Tool use: no verified public score found
- Reasoning: no verified public score found
- Context window: no verified public retrieval measurement (1,048,576 catalog window only)
- Multimodal: no verified public score found (text+image in, text out per models.dev)
- Coding: no verified public score found
- Cost efficiency: $0.30/$1.20 per 1M, $0.006 cached (Vercel AI Gateway, models.dev); free Zen slot per catalog
- Overall Score: not computable — self-excluded (zero verified benchmarks)

If Meituan or an independent evaluator publishes benchmark numbers for `longcat-2.5-preview`, this file can be re-researched and replaced by a scored report.

